  <ym-title|Same-history physical stress transfer and Scribe
  assembly><label|same-history-physical-stress-transfer-and-scribe-assembly>

  <\itemize-minus>
    <item>Unit: YM-000026.

    <item>Status: draft; independent mathematical/source review required.

    <item>Imported Lean revision: <verbatim|3456e5e75cf8d4cd558955a5c7638fba2d68f464>.

    <item>Manuscript: <verbatim|manuscript/existence/trace-scribe-producer.tex>.

    <item>Scope: expose the actual corrected conserved tensor, its
    same-history rescaled field/flux limits, transfer of those limits to the
    physical stress by a nonzero common shell test, and assembly of the
    physical Scribe record.
  </itemize-minus>

